00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:01.350
And from then on, one time
per week and sometimes

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:02.720
even two times per week,

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:04.510
I took a new version of the mock exam

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:07.150
