understand where I'm standing.

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:09.020
This helped me to get a live feedback,

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:11.420
whether I'm on the right
path, whether learning,

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:13.430
the studying that I'm
doing is really helping me

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:14.590
to advance my score.

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:16.560
And in fact the last mock exam that I took

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:19.050
