when I actually looked at this,

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:16.460
but whenever I did mock
exercises, whenever I studied,

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:19.050
I made a point of always
trying to take notes

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:21.510
